#: api/Cloud_Connection_Controller.php:50
msgid "Connect to AtlasVoice Cloud"
msgstr ""

#: api/Cloud_Connection_Controller.php:51
msgid "Connects this site to AtlasVoice Cloud for the natural voice. It sends the site address, the site name and the email to AtlasVoice Cloud and stores the key it returns. From then on, the text of a post is sent to make its audio. Only call it when the site owner has agreed to that: \"consent\" must be true."
msgstr ""

#: api/Cloud_Connection_Controller.php:59
msgid "Where AtlasVoice may contact the site owner about the service."
msgstr ""

#: api/Cloud_Connection_Controller.php:64
msgid "Must be true: the site owner agrees that post text is sent to AtlasVoice Cloud to make the audio."
msgstr ""

#: api/Cloud_Connection_Controller.php:69
msgid "Move a site that is registered to another email to this email. AtlasVoice Cloud checks a one-time code on this site first, so the site must be reachable from the internet."
msgstr ""

#: api/Cloud_Connection_Controller.php:74
msgid "Also share diagnostic data with AtlasAiDev. Only when the site owner chose this."
msgstr ""

#: api/Cloud_Connection_Controller.php:80
msgid "Disconnect from AtlasVoice Cloud"
msgstr ""

#: api/Cloud_Connection_Controller.php:81
msgid "Disconnects this site from AtlasVoice Cloud and forgets its key. New audio then uses the browser voice. Audio that is already made is kept and keeps playing."
msgstr ""

